{
  "lessonId": "L3M1L2",
  "title": "中義稀有品種 (Ciliegiolo, Cesanese)",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0 0%,#7B1FA2 100%)'><h1>🍒 中義稀有品種</h1><p class='subtitle'>Ciliegiolo & Cesanese - 被遺忘的托斯卡納與拉齊奧瑰寶</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍒 Ciliegiolo - 櫻桃之酒</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Tuscany & Umbria</div><h3>Ciliegiolo (奇列焦洛)</h3><div class='name-meaning'><strong>名字由來：</strong>Ciliegia = 櫻桃（義大利文）</div></div><div class='grape-story'><h4>📖 身世之謎</h4><p>長期被認為是 <strong>Sangiovese 的祖先</strong>之一，但 DNA 研究顯示並無直接關聯。真正的起源仍是謎團，但在托斯卡納和翁布里亞有數百年歷史。</p></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card primary'><h5>🍷 核心特徵</h5><ul><li><strong>顏色：</strong>淺至中等的紅寶石色</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12-13.5%（中等）</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中等（比 Sangiovese 低）</li><li><strong>單寧：</strong>柔軟、絲滑</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中等、優雅</li></ul></div><div class='char-card flavor'><h5>🍇 風味圖譜</h5><div class='flavor-category'><h6>🔴 紅色水果主導</h6><ul><li>櫻桃（新鮮與煮熟）</li><li>草莓</li><li>覆盆莓</li></ul></div><div class='flavor-category'><h6>🌸 花香與香料</h6><ul><li>紫羅蘭</li><li>玫瑰花瓣</li><li>白胡椒</li></ul></div></div></div><div class='regional-styles'><h4>🗺️ 三大產區風格</h4><div class='regions-grid'><div class='region-card maremma'><div class='region-badge'>Maremma</div><h5>托斯卡納海岸</h5><ul><li><strong>風格：</strong>果味濃郁、現代</li><li><strong>釀造：</strong>常與 Sangiovese 混釀</li><li><strong>酒莊：</strong>Fattoria Le Pupille</li><li><strong>特色：</strong>溫暖氣候、成熟度高</li></ul></div><div class='region-card umbria'><div class='region-badge'>Umbria</div><h5>翁布里亞</h5><ul><li><strong>風格：</strong>傳統、優雅</li><li><strong>釀造：</strong>單一品種為主</li><li><strong>酒莊：</strong>Paolo Bea（自然酒先驅）</li><li><strong>特色：</strong>純淨、礦物感</li></ul></div><div class='region-card chianti'><div class='region-badge'>Chianti Classico</div><h5>奇揚地經典區</h5><ul><li><strong>風格：</strong>配角、增添香氣</li><li><strong>釀造：</strong>混釀（<5%）</li><li><strong>角色：</strong>柔化單寧、增香</li><li><strong>歷史：</strong>傳統配方成分</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏛️ Cesanese - 羅馬的古老遺產</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Lazio - Cesanese del Piglio DOCG</div><h3>Cesanese (切薩內塞)</h3><div class='rarity-badge'>區域特產 ⭐⭐⭐⭐</div></div><div class='ancient-story'><div class='timeline-header'>📜 2000年的歷史</div><div class='timeline'><div class='timeline-item'><div class='year'>羅馬時代</div><p>古羅馬詩人 <strong>Pliny the Elder</strong> 在著作中提及此葡萄</p></div><div class='timeline-item'><div class='year'>中世紀</div><p>教皇宮廷的御用葡萄酒品種</p></div><div class='timeline-item'><div class='year'>20世紀</div><p>幾近被遺忘，僅剩老農種植</p></div><div class='timeline-item'><div class='year'>2008</div><p><strong>Cesanese del Piglio</strong> 獲得 DOCG 認證</p></div></div></div><div class='varieties-section'><h4>🍇 兩個主要克隆</h4><div class='clones-comparison'><div class='clone-card'><h5>Cesanese Comune</h5><div class='clone-details'><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量高、品質中等</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果味簡單、適合日常飲用</p><p><strong>使用：</strong>傳統 frizzante 風格</p></div></div><div class='clone-card premium'><h5>Cesanese d'Affile ⭐</h5><div class='clone-details'><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量低、品質優異</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>複雜、結構、陳年潛力</p><p><strong>使用：</strong>頂級 DOCG 干型紅酒</p></div></div></div></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 干型風格 (Secco)</h5><ul><li>深紫紅色</li><li>黑櫻桃、黑莓</li><li>藥草、香料（月桂葉）</li><li>中高酸度、強單寧</li><li>陳年潛力 8-15 年</li></ul></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🍾 甜型氣泡 (Dolce)</h5><ul><li>傳統農家風格</li><li>低酒精（7-9%）</li><li>櫻桃、草莓甜美</li><li>輕盈氣泡</li><li>適合甜點搭配</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🔬 兩大品種深度對比</h2><div class='detailed-comparison'><table class='pro-table'><thead><tr><th class='category'>特性</th><th class='ciliegiolo-col'>Ciliegiolo</th><th class='cesanese-col'>Cesanese</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>起源</strong></td><td>托斯卡納/翁布里亞（中世紀）</td><td>拉齊奧（羅馬時代）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DNA親緣</strong></td><td>可能與 Sangiovese 有間接關係</td><td>獨立品種、無明確親緣</td></tr><tr><td><strong>顏色深度</strong></td><td>淺至中等紅寶石</td><td>深紫紅（Affile 克隆）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要風味</strong></td><td>新鮮櫻桃、草莓、紫羅蘭</td><td>黑櫻桃、藥草、月桂葉</td></tr><tr><td><strong>單寧結構</strong></td><td>柔軟、絲滑</td><td>強勁、需要陳年</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酸度</strong></td><td>中等</td><td>中高</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酒體</strong></td><td>中等、優雅</td><td>中飽滿、結構感強</td></tr><tr><td><strong>最佳飲用</strong></td><td>年輕飲用（2-5年）</td><td>陳年後飲用（5-15年）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要產區</strong></td><td>Maremma, Umbria</td><td>Piglio, Olevano Romano</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DOCG認證</strong></td><td>無專屬 DOCG</td><td>Cesanese del Piglio DOCG (2008)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格帶</strong></td><td>€€-€€€</td><td>€€-€€€€</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏅 頂級生產者推薦</h2><div class='producers-showcase'><div class='producer-section ciliegiolo-producers'><h4>🍒 Ciliegiolo 精選酒莊</h4><div class='producers-grid'><div class='winery-card'><h5>Paolo Bea</h5><div class='winery-badge natural'>自然酒先驅</div><p class='location'>📍 Umbria - Montefalco</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Rosso de Veo</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>100% Ciliegiolo, 自然釀造</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>零添加、野生酵母</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€40-60</p></div></div><div class='winery-card'><h5>Fattoria Le Pupille</h5><div class='winery-badge'>Maremma 代表</div><p class='location'>📍 Tuscany - Maremma</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Poggio Valente</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>Ciliegiolo 主導混釀</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>現代風格、果味濃郁</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€25-35</p></div></div><div class='winery-card'><h5>Collecapretta</h5><div class='winery-badge'>傳統風格</div><p class='location'>📍 Tuscany</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Ciliegiolo Superiore</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>100% 單一品種</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>傳統釀造、優雅</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€18-25</p></div></div></div></div><div class='producer-section cesanese-producers'><h4>🏛️ Cesanese 精選酒莊</h4><div class='producers-grid'><div class='winery-card'><h5>Casale della Ioria</h5><div class='winery-badge docg'>DOCG 先鋒</div><p class='location'>📍 Lazio - Piglio</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Cesanese del Piglio Superiore</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>Affile 克隆、干型</p><p><strong>陳年：</strong>橡木桶 18 個月</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€30-45</p></div></div><div class='winery-card'><h5>Coletti Conti</h5><div class='winery-badge'>現代先驅</div><p class='location'>📍 Lazio - Anagni</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Hernicus</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>國際化釀造</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>法國橡木桶、現代</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€35-50</p></div></div><div class='winery-card'><h5>Corte dei Papi</h5><div class='winery-badge'>傳統守護者</div><p class='location'>📍 Lazio - Piglio</p><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Le Mura Saracene</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>傳統釀造</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>老藤、手工採收</p><p><strong>價格：</strong>€20-30</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 專家配餐指南</h2><div class='expert-pairing'><div class='pairing-column'><div class='pairing-title ciliegiolo-title'><h4>🍒 Ciliegiolo 配餐</h4><p class='pairing-philosophy'>輕盈、果味主導 → 簡單、新鮮的料理</p></div><div class='dishes-list'><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🍕</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>瑪格麗特披薩</h5><p>經典搭配，酸度平衡番茄</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🍝</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>Amatriciana 義大利麵</h5><p>番茄培根麵，羅馬經典</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🧀</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>Pecorino 起司</h5><p>中度陳年，托斯卡納特產</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🍖</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>烤豬排</h5><p>簡單調味，凸顯果味</p></div></div></div></div><div class='pairing-column'><div class='pairing-title cesanese-title'><h4>🏛️ Cesanese 配餐</h4><p class='pairing-philosophy'>結構強勁 → 厚重、傳統的羅馬料理</p></div><div class='dishes-list'><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🍝</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>Carbonara</h5><p>經典羅馬麵，濃郁蛋黃醬</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🥩</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>Abbacchio（烤羊羔）</h5><p>羅馬傳統，完美地域配對</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🍖</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>Coda alla Vaccinara</h5><p>燉牛尾，羅馬名菜</p></div></div><div class='dish-item'><div class='dish-emoji'>🧀</div><div class='dish-content'><h5>陳年 Pecorino Romano</h5><p>強烈風味的硬質起司</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class='temperature-guide'><h4>🌡️ 侍酒溫度</h4><div class='temp-bars'><div class='temp-bar'><span class='wine-name'>Ciliegiolo</span><div class='temp-range' style='background:linear-gradient(90deg, #transparent 0%, #ff6b6b 55%, #ff6b6b 75%, transparent 100%)'><span class='temp-mark' style='left:55%'>14°C</span><span class='temp-mark' style='left:75%'>16°C</span></div></div><div class='temp-bar'><span class='wine-name'>Cesanese (年輕)</span><div class='temp-range' style='background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #c92a2a 60%, #c92a2a 80%, transparent 100%)'><span class='temp-mark' style='left:60%'>16°C</span><span class='temp-mark' style='left:80%'>18°C</span></div></div><div class='temp-bar'><span class='wine-name'>Cesanese (陳年)</span><div class='temp-range' style='background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #7f1d1d 65%, #7f1d1d 85%, transparent 100%)'><span class='temp-mark' style='left:65%'>18°C</span><span class='temp-mark' style='left:85%'>20°C</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎯 市場洞察與投資建議</h2><div class='market-insights'><div class='insight-card trend'><div class='card-icon'>📈</div><h4>市場趨勢</h4><ul><li><strong>Ciliegiolo：</strong>自然酒運動推動下復興中</li><li><strong>Cesanese：</strong>DOCG 認證後知名度提升</li><li>國際市場認知度仍低，價格被低估</li><li>頂級酒款有升值潛力</li></ul></div><div class='insight-card availability'><div class='card-icon'>🌍</div><h4>可獲得性</h4><ul><li>義大利本地：容易找到</li><li>歐洲其他國家：專業酒商</li><li>亞洲/美洲：極稀有</li><li>網路購買是主要管道</li></ul></div><div class='insight-card investment'><div class='card-icon'>💎</div><h4>收藏建議</h4><div class='recommendation'><p><strong>值得收藏：</strong></p><ul><li>Paolo Bea Rosso de Veo (Ciliegiolo)</li><li>Casale della Ioria Superiore (Cesanese)</li><li>Coletti Conti Hernicus (Cesanese)</li></ul><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>Cesanese d'Affile 干型可達 15 年</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 專家重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Ciliegiolo 名字源自「櫻桃」，以新鮮櫻桃和紫羅蘭香氣為特色</div><div class='point'>✓ Ciliegiolo 適合年輕飲用，單寧柔軟，不適合長期陳年</div><div class='point'>✓ Paolo Bea 是 Ciliegiolo 自然酒的先驅，國際知名</div><div class='point'>✓ Cesanese 有 2000 年歷史，古羅馬時代已被記載</div><div class='point'>✓ Cesanese d'Affile 克隆品質遠優於 Comune 克隆</div><div class='point'>✓ Cesanese del Piglio DOCG (2008) 是頂級認證</div><div class='point'>✓ Cesanese 干型風格需要陳年，有強勁單寧和藥草風味</div><div class='point'>✓ 兩者都是被低估的品種，有投資潛力</div></div></section></div><style>.grape-profile{background:#fff;padding:40px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.profile-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:35px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:4px solid #9C27B0}.origin-badge{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0,#7B1FA2);color:#fff;padding:10px 25px;border-radius:30px;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(156,39,176,.3)}.profile-header h3{font-size:2.5rem;margin:18px 0;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:800}.name-meaning{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffeaa7);padding:12px 25px;border-radius:25px;display:inline-block;margin-top:10px}.name-meaning strong{color:#e67e22}.grape-story{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f1f3f5,#e9ecef);padding:30px;border-radius:15px;margin:30px 0;border-left:6px solid #9C27B0;box-shadow:0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.grape-story h4{margin:0 0 18px;color:#9C27B0;font-size:1.4rem}.grape-story p{margin:0;line-height:1.9;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.05rem}.grape-story strong{color:#9C27B0;font-weight:700}.characteristics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin:30